  "issue": "\"llamó 'coronarium' a una estructura interior al órgano pineal sin designarla como paráfisis\" presents as fact about Burckhardt what is only absence in the snippet: R005.1 says the snippet \"does not itself call it paraphysis\" and the excerpt never uses the word; the link to the paraphysis rests on finder notes outside the excerpt.",
